{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ud8Y5Ghk8NxzUrGiK8jgUJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Notes\n2\t\n3\t## 2026-04-20 — bill doubled since memory shipped\n4\t\n5\tInput spend roughly doubled in the week after `save_fact` went live (2026-04-13),\n6\twith the same number of messages per day. `logs/usage.jsonl` shows it: on a normal\n7\tmessage the loop rounds and the next message read ~1000 tokens from cache, but\n8\tevery call right after a `save_fact` has `cache_read_input_tokens: 0` and\n9\t`cache_creation_input_tokens` ~1000 again. Athletes tell the bot things about\n10\tthemselves a lot in their first week, so this happens several times per chat.\n11\t\n12\tTried: shorter facts (no change), capping facts at 20 (no change, the number of\n13\tfacts is not the problem). Tool filtering by keyword is from March and was a clear\n14\twin (~75% fewer tool tokens on short messages); leave it.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cf36742-a3f5-449e-af65-0e89f003cad8","uuid":"3a7a5625-0af4-4f57-8373-975c3ef7c1ca","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:03:55.244Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/h-aPUe9E/NOTES.md","content":"# Notes\n\n## 2026-04-20 — bill doubled since memory shipped\n\nInput spend roughly doubled in the week after `save_fact` went live (2026-04-13),\nwith the same number of messages per day. `logs/usage.jsonl` shows it: on a normal\nmessage the loop rounds and the next message read ~1000 tokens from cache, but\nevery call right after a `save_fact` has `cache_read_input_tokens: 0` and\n`cache_creation_input_tokens` ~1000 again. Athletes tell the bot things about\nthemselves a lot in their first week, so this happens several times per chat.\n\nTried: shorter facts (no change), capping facts at 20 (no change, the number of\nfacts is not the problem). Tool filtering by keyword is from March and was a clear\nwin (~75% fewer tool tokens on short messages); leave it.\n","numLines":15,"start